  GrandfatheredRemoval, WitnessDeleted, WitnessRenamed, WitnessNowInsideNewTier,
  RosterChangeVerdict, RosterChangeAdmitted, RosterAdditionRefused, RosterRemovalWithoutDisposition,
  roster_change_verdict, roster_change_admitted, removal_identity,
